L499: ## Outline
L500: 
L501: The appendix provides additional context to the main paper; it contains additional details about the method and the implementation in SAM 3D, as well as ablations.
L502: 
L503: The structure of the appendix is as follows:
L504: 
L505:   1. (i)
L506: 
L507: Data Engine details: A more detailed description the data collection used in the collection step in cite19†Section 3.2.1 .
